# Strategy Capacity & TCA

When the user asks about strategy capacity, ADV participation, market impact,
TCA-style cost estimates, capacity curves, or whether transaction costs eat
alpha at larger AUM, read
`.cursor/skills/strategy-capacity-tca/SKILL.md` and follow its workflow.

Read `references/impact-models.md` for model assumptions and
`references/source_boundary.md` for evidence limits. Use
`scripts/capacity_tca.py` for deterministic calculations. Always separate data
facts from model estimates; do not turn impact estimates into buy/sell advice.
